{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a quirky off-road exploration game where trains don't run on tracks and planes don't fly in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Complete tasks in the game to earn 15+ body parts, 20+ tire parts, 10+ engine parts, and 15+ chassis parts. Even more parts will be added continuously for free in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf The game offers 10 interconnected open worlds with a total area of over 200 square kilometers. You can go anywhere without any restrictions (except beyond the map boundaries).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You can freely assemble a train, plane, or crane, and install diesel engines, jet engines, or rocket engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You can assemble cranes to rescue stranded vehicles or to build bridges, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Plans for future free updates include a cooperative multiplayer mode and Steam Workshop support.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751820?t=1757942716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751820?t=1757942716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751820/b48ae16a9a4b709de12df57ad20f24127390d774/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757942716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751820/b48ae16a9a4b709de12df57ad20f24127390d774/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757942716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a quirky off-road exploration game where trains don't run on tracks and planes don't fly in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Complete tasks in the game to earn 15+ body parts, 20+ tire parts, 10+ engine parts, and 15+ chassis parts. Even more parts will be added continuously for free in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf The game offers 10 interconnected open worlds with a total area of over 200 square kilometers. You can go anywhere without any restrictions (except beyond the map boundaries).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You can freely assemble a train, plane, or crane, and install diesel engines, jet engines, or rocket engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You can assemble cranes to rescue stranded vehicles or to build bridges, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Plans for future free updates include a cooperative multiplayer mode and Steam Workshop support.</p>","developers":["\u96f7\u90fd\u6253\u4e0d\u9192"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751820/7aff4577c1548f2c2b72b9927143ef97071d9622/header.jpg?t=1757942716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193246,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193246/movie480.mp4?t=1757523538","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193246/movie_max.mp4?t=1757523538"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193246/dc54bbf15b6545eb86282f1341a881fb1a095f93/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757523538","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193246/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757523538","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193246/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757523538"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257193223,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193223/movie480.mp4?t=1757523541","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193223/movie_max.mp4?t=1757523541